At least one course at the intermediate or advanced level in any subfield
12 ECTS

Students who opted to enroll in BIOL 490 Honors Thesis Research and BIOL 491 Honors Thesis must successfully: 
1.1. conduct the necessary research towards the completion of BIOL 490 Honors Thesis at the end of the Fall semester of fourth year;
1.2. write the Honors Thesis (BIOL 491) according to the Department’s B.Sc. Thesis Format and Style Guidelines;
1.3. obtain approval of the Honors Thesis the supervisor and advisory committee; 
1.4. pass the thesis defense.
